        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A flat white snowflake with a small sphere centre disc and six cone arms radiating outward at equal intervals. The piece lies flat when the arms are lightly stuffed and kept thin at the base join. Great for hanging decorations."
          }
